1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,933
Imagine kijiye, aap highway par car chala rahe hain, saamne toll
plaza aata hai, aur aap bina ruke nikal jaate hain.

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:12,367
Kuch hi seconds mein aapke phone par SMS aata
hai, ki toll ka paisa kat gaya.

3
00:00:12,833 --> 00:00:17,867
Lekin bina cash, bina card, aur bina ruke, ye
paisa kata kaise?

4
00:00:18,333 --> 00:00:21,833
Windshield par laga ye chhota sa sticker, aakhir
karta kya hai?

5
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:26,433
Aaj hum FASTag ke peeche ki technology ko, step
by step samjhenge.

6
00:00:30,733 --> 00:00:33,333
Sabse pehle samajhte hain ki FASTag actually hai
kya.

7
00:00:33,433 --> 00:00:38,267
FASTag ek chhota sa RFID sticker hai, jo gaadi
ki windshield par lagaya jaata hai.

8
00:00:39,167 --> 00:00:42,700
Ye aapki gaadi ko ek prepaid wallet ya bank
account se link karta hai.

9
00:00:42,767 --> 00:00:47,167
Iska kaam hai, toll plaza par bina ruke,
automatically toll payment karna.

10
00:00:47,233 --> 00:00:52,367
FASTag, National Electronic Toll Collection,
yaani NETC program ka hissa hai.

11
00:00:52,433 --> 00:00:58,333
Is NETC system ko NPCI ne develop kiya hai, wahi
NPCI jo UPI bhi chalata hai.

12
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:03,400
India mein February 2021 se, zyaadatar gaadiyon
ke liye FASTag zaroori kar diya gaya.

13
00:01:03,467 --> 00:01:07,900
Isse toll plaza par lambi lines kam huin, aur
cash ka jhanjhat bhi.

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,767
FASTag lete samay, gaadi ki RC aur KYC documents
ki zaroorat hoti hai.

15
00:01:14,133 --> 00:01:17,733
Chaliye, pehle FASTag system ke main parts ko
samajhte hain.

16
00:01:19,767 --> 00:01:22,933
Pehla hai FASTag tag, jismein ek unique Tag ID
hoti hai.

17
00:01:22,967 --> 00:01:28,033
Doosra hai toll plaza ka RFID reader aur
antenna, jo lane ke upar lage hote hain.

18
00:01:28,100 --> 00:01:32,400
Teesra hai toll plaza ka computer system, jo har
lane ka data sambhaalta hai.

19
00:01:32,467 --> 00:01:37,100
Chautha hai Acquirer Bank, yaani wo bank jo toll
plaza ki taraf se payment leta hai.

20
00:01:37,200 --> 00:01:42,600
Paanchvaan hai Issuer Bank, yaani wo bank jisne aapko
FASTag diya hai, aur jahan aapka wallet hai.

21
00:01:42,667 --> 00:01:48,967
Aur in sabke beech hai NPCI ka NETC system, jo
messages ko sahi bank tak route karta hai.

22
00:01:49,033 --> 00:01:56,867
Alag-alag banks tag issue karte hain, lekin NETC ki wajah se, aapka
tag desh ke har FASTag toll plaza par kaam karta hai.

23
00:01:58,200 --> 00:02:03,567
Ab sabse interesting sawaal. Is chhote se sticker mein to
battery bhi nahi hoti, phir ye kaam kaise karta hai?

24
00:02:03,667 --> 00:02:08,733
FASTag mein RFID technology hoti hai, yaani
Radio Frequency Identification.

25
00:02:08,800 --> 00:02:13,233
Sticker ke andar ek chhoti si chip, aur uske
chaaron taraf ek patla antenna hota hai.

26
00:02:14,700 --> 00:02:19,400
Jab gaadi reader ke paas aati hai, to reader
radio waves bhejta hai.

27
00:02:19,467 --> 00:02:25,033
Inhi radio waves se tag ki chip ko thodi si
energy milti hai, aur wo active ho jaati hai.

28
00:02:25,100 --> 00:02:30,033
Phir tag apni unique ID, radio signal ke zariye
wapas reader ko bhej deta hai.

29
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:35,300
Ise passive RFID kehte hain, isliye FASTag ko
battery ya charging ki zaroorat nahi hoti.

30
00:02:35,367 --> 00:02:39,267
Dhyaan dijiye, tag ke andar aapka paisa ya bank
details nahi hoti.

31
00:02:39,300 --> 00:02:45,733
Tag sirf ek ID batata hai, aur baaki saara kaam
banks aur NETC system ke servers par hota hai.

32
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:52,733
India mein FASTag, UHF band ki radio frequency par kaam karta hai,
isliye reader kuch meter door se bhi tag read kar sakta hai.

33
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:59,533
Agar sticker mud jaaye ya phat jaaye, to uska antenna kharaab
ho sakta hai, aur reader use read nahi kar paata.

34
00:03:00,867 --> 00:03:04,300
Ab dekhte hain, toll plaza par step by step asal
mein kya hota hai.

35
00:03:04,367 --> 00:03:09,233
Maan lijiye aapke FASTag wallet mein paanch sau
rupaye hain, aur toll pachaanve rupaye ka hai.

36
00:03:09,967 --> 00:03:14,900
Jaise hi car FASTag lane mein aati hai, reader
tag ki ID read kar leta hai.

37
00:03:14,967 --> 00:03:19,000
Toll plaza ka system is ID se tag ki details aur
status check karta hai.

38
00:03:19,067 --> 00:03:24,800
Plaza ke paas tags ki ek updated status list
rehti hai, taaki check bahut jaldi ho sake.

39
00:03:24,833 --> 00:03:31,500
Agar tag valid hai, to gaadi ki class ke hisaab se toll
amount tay hota hai, aur barrier khul jaata hai.

40
00:03:31,567 --> 00:03:35,733
Phir toll plaza, transaction ko apne Acquirer
Bank ko bhejta hai.

41
00:03:35,833 --> 00:03:42,200
Acquirer Bank, NPCI ke NETC system ke zariye, ye
request aapke Issuer Bank tak pahunchata hai.

42
00:03:42,233 --> 00:03:48,067
Issuer Bank aapke FASTag wallet se pachaanve
rupaye debit kar deta hai.

43
00:03:48,167 --> 00:03:53,067
Iske baad settlement ke zariye, ye paisa toll
plaza waale account tak pahunchta hai.

44
00:03:53,133 --> 00:03:55,533
Aur aapke phone par debit ka SMS aa jaata hai.

45
00:03:55,600 --> 00:04:02,533
Dhyaan dijiye, barrier turant khul sakta hai, lekin debit ka
SMS kabhi-kabhi thodi der baad bhi aa sakta hai.

46
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:07,400
Kai toll plazas par cameras bhi, gaadi ki number
plate aur class ko check karte hain.

47
00:04:07,433 --> 00:04:11,300
Aur ye poora process, zyaadatar bas kuch hi
seconds mein poora ho jaata hai.

48
00:04:12,667 --> 00:04:15,467
Ab sawaal ye hai, toll amount kaise tay hota
hai?

49
00:04:15,533 --> 00:04:21,100
Har FASTag gaadi ki class se link hota hai, jaise car,
light commercial vehicle, bus ya truck.

50
00:04:21,133 --> 00:04:25,800
Har toll plaza ka apna fee rate hota hai, jo
vehicle class ke hisaab se alag-alag hota hai.

51
00:04:25,867 --> 00:04:29,233
Isliye truck ka toll, car se zyaada hota hai.

52
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:33,167
Kai plazas par return journey ya monthly pass
jaise options bhi mil sakte hain.

53
00:04:33,267 --> 00:04:37,333
Agar kabhi galat class ka toll kate, to apne
Issuer Bank se complaint kar sakte hain.

54
00:04:37,367 --> 00:04:42,333
Toll rates, sarkaar ke tay rules ke hisaab se,
samay-samay par update hote hain.

55
00:04:43,533 --> 00:04:48,967
Har toll plaza ka fee rate, NHAI ki official
website ya app par dekha ja sakta hai.

56
00:04:50,733 --> 00:04:56,233
Kabhi-kabhi FASTag hote hue bhi, toll plaza par
gaadi ruk jaati hai. Aisa kyon?

57
00:04:56,300 --> 00:04:58,633
Iska sabse common reason hai low balance.

58
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:03,767
Agar wallet mein zaroori balance nahi hai, to tag low
balance ya blacklist status mein ja sakta hai.

59
00:05:03,833 --> 00:05:08,567
KYC poori na hona, ya vehicle details ka match
na hona bhi ek reason ho sakta hai.

60
00:05:08,633 --> 00:05:15,167
NHAI ki One Vehicle One FASTag policy ke tahat,
ek gaadi par ek hi active FASTag hona chahiye.

61
00:05:15,200 --> 00:05:19,733
Valid FASTag na hone par, aapko normal se zyaada
toll dena pad sakta hai.

62
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:23,100
Isliye trip se pehle balance aur tag status
zaroor check kar lein.

63
00:05:23,167 --> 00:05:27,233
Recharge karne ke baad, tag ka status kuch samay
mein phir se active ho jaata hai.

64
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:31,400
Ab baat karte hain recharge ki.

65
00:05:31,467 --> 00:05:36,667
Zyaadatar FASTag, prepaid wallet ki tarah kaam karte
hain, jise aap pehle se recharge karte hain.

66
00:05:36,733 --> 00:05:42,367
Aap Issuer Bank ki app, net banking, ya UPI
waale payment apps se recharge kar sakte hain.

67
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:46,767
Kuch banks, FASTag ko seedhe aapke bank account
se link karne ka option bhi dete hain.

68
00:05:46,833 --> 00:05:51,233
Recharge ke baad balance update hone mein,
kabhi-kabhi thoda time lag sakta hai.

69
00:05:51,300 --> 00:05:54,800
Isliye lambe safar se pehle, recharge thoda
pehle kar lena behtar hai.

70
00:05:54,867 --> 00:05:58,600
Kai banks, balance kam hone par SMS alert bhi
bhejte hain.

71
00:05:58,667 --> 00:06:04,300
Kuch apps mein auto recharge ka option bhi hota hai, jisse
balance kam hote hi wallet apne aap recharge ho jaata hai.

72
00:06:05,667 --> 00:06:08,467
Agar FASTag se judi koi problem ho, to kya
karein?

73
00:06:08,500 --> 00:06:13,067
Kabhi tag read nahi hota, kyonki wo kharaab ho
gaya hai, ya galat jagah laga hai.

74
00:06:13,133 --> 00:06:17,767
FASTag ko windshield par, rear view mirror ke
peeche, beech mein lagana chahiye.

75
00:06:17,867 --> 00:06:22,133
Kabhi-kabhi ek hi toll do baar kat jaata hai, ya
galat amount kat jaata hai.

76
00:06:22,167 --> 00:06:27,433
Aise mein SMS aur transaction details sambhaal kar
rakhein, aur apne Issuer Bank mein complaint karein.

77
00:06:27,500 --> 00:06:32,700
Highway se judi madad ke liye, NHAI ka helpline
number 1033 bhi hai.

78
00:06:32,767 --> 00:06:37,367
Check karne ke baad, agar deduction galat paaya
gaya, to refund mil sakta hai.

79
00:06:37,433 --> 00:06:42,367
Complaint karte samay, vehicle number, date,
time aur toll plaza ka naam zaroor bataayein.

80
00:06:43,733 --> 00:06:47,100
FASTag safe hai, lekin kuch baaton ka dhyaan
rakhna zaroori hai.

81
00:06:47,167 --> 00:06:50,633
FASTag sirf bank, official app ya authorized
point se hi lein.

82
00:06:50,733 --> 00:06:56,200
FASTag ya KYC ke naam par aaye call ya link par,
apna OTP ya PIN share mat kijiye.

83
00:06:56,267 --> 00:07:00,900
Tag ko nikaal kar doosri gaadi par mat lagaiye,
kyonki tag ek hi gaadi ke liye hota hai.

84
00:07:00,967 --> 00:07:04,333
Gaadi bechte samay puraana FASTag close karwana
na bhoolein.

85
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:09,200
Aur SMS alerts hamesha on rakhein, taaki har
deduction ki jaankaari milti rahe.

86
00:07:10,067 --> 00:07:15,467
Agar FASTag kho jaaye ya chori ho jaaye, to turant apne
Issuer Bank ko bata kar tag block karwaayein.

87
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:19,767
Aage chal kar toll collection aur bhi smart hone
waala hai.

88
00:07:19,867 --> 00:07:26,367
Satellite yaani GNSS based tolling par kaam chal raha hai,
jismein toll tay ki gayi doori ke hisaab se kat sakta hai.

89
00:07:26,433 --> 00:07:31,667
Number plate pehchaanne waale cameras bhi, is
system ko aur fast bana sakte hain.

90
00:07:31,733 --> 00:07:39,067
To recap karein, reader aapke tag ki ID read karta hai, plaza
system status check karta hai, aur barrier khul jaata hai.

91
00:07:39,133 --> 00:07:44,967
Phir Acquirer Bank, NETC system aur Issuer Bank
milkar, aapke wallet se toll debit karte hain.

92
00:07:45,033 --> 00:07:48,933
Ek chhota sa sticker, asal mein ek bade
connected payment network ki kahaani hai.

93
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:56,200
Agar aapko technology ke peeche ke aise systems samajhna achha lagta
hai, to video ko like kijiye, aur channel ko subscribe kijiye.

94
00:07:56,233 --> 00:07:58,367
Milte hain agle video mein. Thank you!
